/* 상점 화면 — 바이올렛 테마(제목 판 · 탭 · 가방 판은 장비 화면과 같다) + 캐주얼 스티커 카드.
   시안: Shared/Design/UI상점_D_최종_시안.png · UI상점_D_가치강조_애니.gif
   부품 그림: UIToolkit/Shop (카드 바탕 · 광택 버튼 · 리본 · 말풍선 · 돋보기 · 히어로 패스 배너) */

/* ── 탭 줄 · 목록 판 ── */

.shop-tabs-wrap {
	margin: 0 -6px;
}

.theme-violet .shop-tabs-wrap .tabs {
	margin: 0;
	padding-top: 12px;
}

.tab {
	font-size: 36px;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
}

.sheet {
	flex-grow: 1;
	margin: 0 -6px;
	padding: 0 26px;
	background-color: #3A3060;
	border-top-width: 4px;
	border-top-color: #6D5ACD;
}

.shop-list {
	flex-grow: 1;
}

.shop-list .unity-scroll-view__content-container {
	padding-bottom: 30px;
}

.shop-group-title {
	margin: 22px 0 16px 6px;
	font-size: 44px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	text-shadow: 0 4px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
}

/* 낱개 상품 3열 */
.shop-grid {
	flex-direction: row;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	margin: 0 -1%;
}

/* ── 카드 공통 — 검정 테(아래 두껍게 = 그림자) 안에 흰 테 + 색 바탕 그림 ── */

.shop-card {
	margin-bottom: 34px;
	border-width: 4px 4px 10px 4px;
	border-color: #0A0814;
	border-radius: 28px;
}

.shop-card__face {
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	top: 0;
	right: 0;
	bottom: 0;
	border-width: 6px;
	border-color: #FFFFFF;
	border-radius: 24px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-and-crop;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/card_purple.png");
}

.shop-card--c-gold .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_gold.png"); }
.shop-card--c-pink .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_pink.png"); }
.shop-card--c-teal .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_teal.png"); }
.shop-card--c-purple .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_purple.png"); }
.shop-card--c-blue .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_blue.png"); }
.shop-card--c-gray .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_gray.png"); }
.shop-card--c-yellow .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_yellow.png"); }
.shop-card--c-red .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_red.png"); }
.shop-card--c-green .shop-card__face { background-image: url("../../Shop/card_green.png"); }

/* 이름 — 굵은 흰 글자 + 검정 외곽선 + 아래 그림자 */
.shop-card__title {
	font-size: 52px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 3px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: #0A0814;
	text-shadow: 0 5px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
	white-space: nowrap;
	overflow: hidden;
	text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.shop-card__desc {
	margin-top: 6px;
	font-size: 28px;
	color: #FFF8EE;
	text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #0A0814;
	white-space: normal;
}

/* ── 구매 버튼 — 카드 맨 아래 가운데. 그림(광택 버튼)은 좌우 40px 9-slice, 아래 8px 는 그림자 ── */

.shop-buy {
	position: absolute;
	bottom: 26px;
	left: 50%;
	width: 380px;
	height: 88px;
	margin: 0 0 0 -190px;
	padding: 0 0 12px 0;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	border-width: 0;
	border-radius: 0;
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
	background-image: url("../../Shop/btn_green.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 40;
	-unity-slice-right: 40;
	-unity-slice-top: 0;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 0;
}

.shop-buy:hover {
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
}

.shop-buy:active {
	translate: 0 4px;
}

.shop-buy--gold {
	background-image: url("../../Shop/btn_gold.png");
}

.shop-buy--violet {
	background-image: url("../../Shop/btn_violet.png");
}

.shop-buy:disabled {
	opacity: 1;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/btn_disabled.png");
}

.shop-buy__icon {
	width: 46px;
	height: 46px;
	margin-right: 8px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-buy__price {
	font-size: 40px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 3px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: #0A0814;
	text-shadow: 0 3px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
}

/* ── 리본 · 구매 횟수 · 돋보기 ── */

/* 카드 위 테두리에 걸쳐 단다 — 카드 안쪽 이름·그림을 가리지 않는다 */
.shop-ribbon {
	position: absolute;
	left: -16px;
	top: -32px;
	height: 62px;
	padding: 0 24px 12px 22px;
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
	font-size: 28px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 2px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: #0A0814;
	text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
	background-image: url("../../Shop/ribbon_red.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 24;
	-unity-slice-right: 16;
	-unity-slice-top: 0;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 0;
}

.shop-ribbon--violet {
	background-image: url("../../Shop/ribbon_violet.png");
}

.shop-count {
	position: absolute;
	top: 26px;
	right: 26px;
	height: 48px;
	padding: 0 20px;
	border-radius: 24px;
	border-width: 2px;
	border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
	background-color: rgba(10, 8, 20, 0.75);
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
	font-size: 26px;
	color: #EBE8FA;
	text-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
}

.shop-count--lack {
	color: #FF7A7A;
}

/* 돋보기가 있는 카드 — 구매 횟수는 그 왼쪽 */
.shop-card--has-info .shop-count {
	right: 118px;
}

.shop-info {
	position: absolute;
	top: 6px;
	right: 6px;
	width: 96px;
	height: 102px;
	padding: 0;
	margin: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
	background-image: url("../../Shop/btn_magnifier.png");
}

.shop-info:hover {
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
}

.shop-info:active {
	translate: 0 3px;
}

/* ── 낱개(3열 칸) — 위 이름, 가운데 그림, 수량, 버튼 위 가치 말풍선, 맨 아래 버튼 ── */

.shop-card--tile {
	width: 31.3%;
	height: 484px;
	margin: 0 1% 26px 1%;
	align-items: center;
}

.shop-card--tile .shop-card__title {
	margin-top: 22px;
	font-size: 44px;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 2px;
	text-shadow: 0 5px 0 #0A0814;
}

.shop-card__media {
	width: 160px;
	height: 140px;
	margin-top: 2px;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
}

.shop-card__currency {
	width: 160px;
	height: 140px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card__item {
	width: 140px;
	height: 140px;
}

.shop-card__amount {
	margin-top: -4px;
	font-size: 44px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 3px;
	-unity-text-outline-color: #0A0814;
	text-shadow: 0 4px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
}

.shop-card--tile .shop-buy {
	left: 18px;
	right: 18px;
	width: auto;
	margin-left: 0;
}

/* 가치 말풍선 — 버튼 위 가운데에 띄우고, 꼬리 끝이 버튼 윗변에 닿는다. 주기적으로 빛 띠가 지나가고 살짝 커진다(ShopUI) */
.shop-bubble {
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	right: 0;
	bottom: 112px;
	align-items: center;
}

.shop-bubble__body {
	height: 52px;
	padding: 0 20px;
	justify-content: center;
	overflow: hidden;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/bubble_body.png");
	-unity-slice-left: 24;
	-unity-slice-right: 24;
	-unity-slice-top: 0;
	-unity-slice-bottom: 0;
	transition-property: scale;
	transition-duration: 0.18s;
	transition-timing-function: ease-out;
}

/* 외곽선 없이 아래 그림자만 — 외곽선을 두르면 작은 글자 속이 깎여 흐려 보인다 */
.shop-bubble__text {
	font-size: 30px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 0;
	text-shadow: 0 3px 0 #0A0814;
	-unity-font-definition: url("../../../Art/UI/Fonts/Pretendard/Pretendard-ExtraBold.ttf");
}

.shop-bubble__tail {
	width: 32px;
	height: 18px;
	margin-top: -3px;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/bubble_tail.png");
}

.shop-bubble__shine {
	position: absolute;
	top: 0;
	bottom: 0;
	left: -40%;
	width: 48px;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/shine.png");
	-unity-background-scale-mode: stretch-to-fill;
}

.shop-bubble--shine .shop-bubble__shine {
	left: 120%;
	transition-property: left;
	transition-duration: 0.6s;
	transition-timing-function: ease-in-out;
}

.shop-bubble--pulse .shop-bubble__body {
	scale: 1.1 1.1;
}

/* ── 가로 카드(보물상자 · 광고 제거 · 칸 확장) — 왼쪽 그림, 오른쪽 이름 · 설명, 맨 아래 가운데 버튼 ── */

.shop-card--row {
	height: 320px;
	padding: 40px 30px 0 280px;
}

.shop-card__art {
	position: absolute;
	left: 46px;
	top: 26px;
	width: 190px;
	height: 190px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card--row .shop-card__title {
	margin-right: 200px;
}

/* 자동분해 — 왼쪽 아래(그림 밑) 작은 체크 */
.shop-card__check {
	position: absolute;
	left: 40px;
	bottom: 44px;
	flex-direction: row;
	align-items: center;
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0;
	border-width: 0;
	background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
	font-size: 28px;
	color: #FFFFFF;
	text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #0A0814;
}

.shop-card__check-box {
	width: 40px;
	height: 40px;
	margin-right: 10px;
	border-width: 3px;
	border-color: #0A0814;
	border-radius: 10px;
	background-color: #FFFFFF;
}

.shop-card__check-box--on {
	background-color: #5CD668;
}

/* ── 히어로 패스 — 주력 상품: 높은 카드, 위 배너 그림(로고 + 보상 부채꼴), 이름 · 설명, 맨 아래 버튼 ── */

.shop-card--pass {
	height: 560px;
	align-items: center;
}

.shop-card__banner {
	position: absolute;
	left: 0;
	right: 0;
	top: 0;
	height: 330px;
	background-image: url("../../Shop/pass_banner.png");
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card--pass .shop-card__title {
	margin-top: 286px;
	font-size: 64px;
	-unity-text-outline-width: 4px;
	text-shadow: 0 6px 0 #0A0814;
}

.shop-card--pass .shop-card__desc {
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
	font-size: 30px;
}

/* ── 패키지 — 왼쪽 위 그림, 이름 · 구성 수, 가운데 구성 칸(누르면 아이템 정보), 맨 아래 버튼 ── */

.shop-card--package {
	height: 508px;
	padding: 48px 30px 0 300px;
}

.shop-card--package .shop-card__title {
	margin-right: 170px;
}

.shop-card__package-art {
	position: absolute;
	left: 36px;
	top: 12px;
	width: 230px;
	height: 190px;
}

.shop-card__package-main {
	position: absolute;
	left: 40px;
	top: 0;
	width: 160px;
	height: 160px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card__package-sub {
	position: absolute;
	width: 100px;
	height: 100px;
	-unity-background-scale-mode: scale-to-fit;
}

.shop-card__package-sub--a {
	left: 0;
	top: 60px;
	rotate: 20deg;
}

.shop-card__package-sub--b {
	left: 140px;
	top: 96px;
}

.shop-card__package {
	position: absolute;
	left: 26px;
	right: 26px;
	top: 210px;
	flex-direction: row;
	justify-content: center;
}

/* 구성 칸 — 한 줄 6칸까지 들어가는 크기 */
.shop-card__package .item-cell {
	width: 150px;
	height: 150px;
	margin: 0 4px;
}

/* 레벨·개수 배지는 칸 안쪽 폭을 다 쓰고 가운데 정렬 — 가방 칸(180)용 32px 그대로면 칸 밖으로 넘친다 */
.theme-violet .shop-card__package .item-cell__level,
.theme-violet .shop-card__package .item-cell__count {
	left: 13px;
	right: 13px;
	padding: 0 4px 2px 4px;
	font-size: 26px;
	-unity-text-align: middle-center;
}
